      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Designation of Director; oversight duties. Pursuant to section 6-129(c)(14) of the Administrative Code, the Counsel to the Mayor is hereby designated the \"Director\" and as of the effective date of Local Law 1 of 2013 shall have all the rights and responsibilities associated with that position. These powers shall include, but not be limited to:",
